<BillSectionHeader><BillSectionNumber><TextRun>Sec. </TextRun><Value>4</Value><TextRun>.  </TextRun></BillSectionNumber>A new section is added to <ChapterCite><TextRun>chapter </TextRun><TitleNumber>46</TitleNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><ChapterNumber>04</ChapterNumber><TextRun> RCW</TextRun></ChapterCite> to read as follows:</BillSectionHeader>
